	quest.0B673D34595AB5C1.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Mechanical Arm can take or deposit items from various blocks within a 5 block radius of where it is placed.&r"
		""
		"&6The order it does this in is determined by its behavior as well as the order the blocks were selected in during placement. &r"
		""
		"A placed Mechanical Arm's selected blocks &6can be viewed by hovering over it with a Wrench.&r "
		""
		"The Mechanical Arm is capable of transferring up to a stack of items at once."
	]
	quest.0B673D34595AB5C1.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Arm is used to transfer items."
	quest.0B673D34595AB5C1.title: "&6Mechanical Arm&r"
	quest.0B9791DEAFF57932.title: "&bA Great Start!"
	quest.0BA55484AA4AACEC.quest_desc: [
		"&6To control the speed of an encased chain the Adjustable Chain Gearshift must be placed in line with Encased Chain Drives with sides touching. &r"
		""
		"&6To increase the speed of an encased chain, an Adjustable Chain Gearshift must be connected to the source of rotational power by its axis and it must be powered by a redstone signal&r. A full strength redstone signal will double the speed of the chain. A partial strength signal, such as given by an analog lever, will give a proportional increase in speed between 1x and 2x."
		""
		"&6If a redstone-powered Adjustable Chain Gearshift receives its rotational power from an encased chain, then it will reduce the rotation speed of its axis by up to half&r, again depending on the strength of the redstone signal."
	]
	quest.0BA55484AA4AACEC.quest_subtitle: "The Adjustable Chain Gearshift functions similarly to Encased Chain Drive, but can change the speed of the output when powered with redstone."
	quest.0BA55484AA4AACEC.title: "&6Adjustable Chain Gearshift&r"
