	quest.0C9276D1368CFD3F.quest_desc: [
		"A tool for configuring &6Source Relays&r and &6automation entities&r."
		""
		"To set a transfer path, &6use the wand&r on the object that you would like to &6take source from&r, and then use it on the block you would like to send source to. "
		""
		"For example: &6Source Jar&r to &6Source Relay&r, Source Relay to Source Relay, or Source Relay to Source Jar."
		""
		"To clear connections, &6sneak and use this wand&r on a relay and if you sneak-use it on the air it will switch to &6Strict mode&r, allowing to specify the side of the blocks to use."
	]
