	quest.11427DCDBEE1FE83.quest_desc: [
		"You're now playing &6my personal&r Chill/Cozy Modpack I made &6some time ago&r... "
		""
		"So, I decided to release this modpack with &6Create Aeronautics&r, so you can enjoy a Cozy Experience with that mod and other &6Create addons&r while keeping the cozy feeling y'know what I mean. "
		""
		"Obviously I'd like to &6explain&r to you which mods I really like."
		""
		"&a1)&r &6Easy Villagers&r because you can trade with them without any problem oh my godness, you can do the same thing with &6Piglins&r hehe."
		""
		"&a2)&r &6Ender's Cataclysm&r obviously, so there is a little &6storyline&r about that."
		""
		"&a3)&r &6Ars Nouveau&r is MY FAVORITE MAGIC mod, so don't try to judge that mod."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&a4)&r &6BetterEnd by Raijin&r... that's my favorite End, absolute cinema."
		""
		"&a5)&r &6Twilight Forest&r made the story, &6Tamaized&r is one of the best mod developer I've ever known, huge thanks to him!"
		""
		"&a6)&r Some &6Let's Do mods&r like &6Meadow&r, &6Vinery&r and many more!"
	]
