	quest.14CDE20DFF20FA56.quest_subtitle: "This Dimension has made the History in Minecraft, don't judge, don't say anything about it. Just explore and live the moment."
	quest.14CDE20DFF20FA56.title: "&6This Has Made The History"
	quest.14E7070BCBA732DC.quest_desc: [
		"For the &6Spell Parchment&r, you need to craft a Blank Parchment first."
		""
		"So you need to prepare the &6Scribe's Table&r down and right-click a Blank Parchment &6onto the table&r."
		""
		"After this, open your &6Spell Book&r and &6choose the specific spell&r you want to put onto the parchment, and then you can scribe the parchment crouching with Shift + Right Click the Scribe's Table."
		""
		"After this the spell will be transferred onto the parchment."
	]
	quest.14E7070BCBA732DC.quest_subtitle: "Do Mageblooms first"
	quest.14E7070BCBA732DC.title: "&6I Think This is Good&r"
	quest.15D088F70CEDAD11.quest_desc: [
		"How does it work: "
		""
		"&6Two Cogwheels interlock when placed next to each other (not diagonally) and facing the same direction.&r When rotational force is provided to one of the cogwheels, &6the force will be provided to the other Cogwheel at the same speed&r but in the opposite direction."
		""
		"&6And two Large Cogwheels interlock when placed perpendicular to each other&r, effectively changing its axis and direction, but not its speed."
		""
		"&6Remember: A Cogwheel and a Large Cogwheel interlock when placed diagonally to each other and facing the same direction.&r The Large Cogwheel will rotate at half the speed of the Cogwheel."
	]
	quest.15D088F70CEDAD11.quest_subtitle: "The Cogwheel is a basic mechanical component that relays rotation."
	quest.15D088F70CEDAD11.title: "&6&lCogwheels Are So Important&r"
	quest.1661B4714948D186.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Volcanic Sourcelink&r generates Source by &6consuming&r burnable items."
		""
		"Archwood logs &6will generate&r bonus Source, with &6Blazing Archwood&r generating the most. "
		""
		"As the &6Volcanic Sourcelink&r produces Source, it also produces heat, used for spawning Lava Lilies and converting stone into lava."
		""
		"The &6Volcanic Sourcelink&r automatically outputs to nearby jars, starting with the one closest to it."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Nearby &6Blazing Archwood&r items will be burned up in exchange &6for a chunk&r of Source and a moderate amount of heat."
		""
		"The &6Volcanic Sourcelink&r will also take items from &6surrounding pedestals&r."
		""
		"You need to know that the &6Volcanic Sourcelink&r will occasionally convert Stone into Magma Blocks, and Magma Blocks into Lava."
		""
		"This conversion is dependent on the &6amount of heat&r it has produced over time. "
		""
		"The &6Volcanic Sourcelink&r will also spawn a Lava Lily adjacent to it given that there is nothing covering the lava."
	]
	quest.1661B4714948D186.quest_subtitle: "do you like reading or not...?"
	quest.1661B4714948D186.title: "&6Volcanic Sourcelink&r"
	quest.16F1625A554576C9.title: "&6Tablet of Flight&r"
	quest.1726138A6E6FBB12.quest_desc: [
		"Whilst being similar in function to the normal &6Propeller Bearings&r, &6Gyroscopic Propeller Bearings&r attempt to stabilize the &6simulated contraption&r they are placed on by tilting the attached propeller up to 12° in order to face directly up, if orientated upwards. "
		""
		"And when orientated downward, it will aim away from down proportionally to how far the contraption is tilting."
	]
	quest.1726138A6E6FBB12.title: "&6Gyroscopic Propeller Bearing"
	quest.176865CC52F81993.quest_desc: ["Obviously you need the &6Mixing Cauldron&r to get the &6Reading Glasses&r, right-click and you'll &6read better&r."]
	quest.176865CC52F81993.quest_subtitle: "need glasses? seriously?"
	quest.176865CC52F81993.title: "&6Do You Need Help Reading?"
	quest.179D1F2DA86B34A8.quest_desc: ["&6Ion Thruster&r is a Forge/NeoForge-compatible propulsion component that runs entirely on &6Forge Energy (FE)&r rather than traditional fuel"]
	quest.179D1F2DA86B34A8.quest_subtitle: "Needs Forge Energy"
	quest.179D1F2DA86B34A8.title: "&6Ion Thruster"
	quest.17CC37D46A81EFAC.quest_subtitle: "Third Tier"
	quest.17CC37D46A81EFAC.title: "&6Half-Way Point"
	quest.1860F6130AF155E8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blaze Cake can be used to feed the Blaze Burner, making it Super-Heated.&r "
		""
		"The Blaze &6becomes Super-Heated for 160 seconds.&r It then turns into standard blaze, lasting for 250 seconds. Finally, the Blaze becomes smoldering, and does not provide any heat."
		""
		"Also, used to obtain the &6&lZaka Star&r."
	]
	quest.1860F6130AF155E8.quest_subtitle: "Blaze Cake is used to fed a Blaze Burner in order to make it Super-Heated."
	quest.1860F6130AF155E8.title: "&6&lMy Favorite Cake!&r"
	quest.1872C160E146EE54.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Charm of Keeping&r is a single-use item resembling a lock that &6prevents inventory loss&r upon death."
		""
		"It comes in three levels (I, II, III), consuming itself to save armor, held items, or the entire inventory respectively."
		""
		"It must be in the player's inventory to activate upon clicking Respawn. "
	]
	quest.1872C160E146EE54.quest_subtitle: "I can't lost my inventory with these woooow"
	quest.1872C160E146EE54.title: "&fCharm of Keeping"
	quest.18F015A642EF0A74.quest_desc: ["              15 Attack Damage"]
	quest.18F015A642EF0A74.quest_subtitle: "The ability can be used it while sneaking it by pressing right-click."
	quest.18F015A642EF0A74.title: "&bSoul Render&r"
	quest.190E204F16194B16.title: "&6Tablet of Awakening&r"
	quest.195CDF1B42271F2C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Generates&r a moderate amount of &6source&r from &6nearby food&r, generating more for more nourishing food. "
		""
		"&6Source Berry&r food is worth far more than other mundane foods. "
		""
		"Additionally, the &6Mycelial Sourcelink&r will convert Grass or Dirt in the 3x3 below it into Mycelium and will grow mushrooms around it given that the space is empty."
		""
		"The Sourcelink will also pull items from &6nearby pedestals&r."
	]
	quest.195CDF1B42271F2C.title: "&6Mycelial Sourcelink&r"
	quest.196E61F8A7A93B3B.quest_subtitle: "The Hand Crank is used to operate the machines' mechanism manually."
	quest.196E61F8A7A93B3B.title: "&6Eat before using this.&r"
	quest.1A0E416F2160D2D9.quest_desc: [
		"It is &6used to&r whitelist or blacklist &6specific items&r, allowing precise sorting into connected chests. "
		""
		"It offers up to 9 slots for items (stackable), supports NBT matching (configurable), and can be used in either the &6Inventory Cable Connector&r or the &6Basic Inventory Hopper&r to manage storage."
	]
	quest.1A0E416F2160D2D9.quest_subtitle: "Read Description"
	quest.1A0E416F2160D2D9.title: "&6You Should Try This&r"
	quest.1A42B25B083003F0.title: "Tri-Bow"
	quest.1A7F8B304EB4C71E.quest_desc: [
		"This creature can be summoned by performing a ritual with the &6Ritual Brazier&r."
		""
		"In order to summon &dWilden Chimera&r, you need to fast out, put down a &6Ritual Brazier&r, then get a tablet of summon Wilden."
		"This takes three items from weld drops, a block of lapis lazuli and an awkward log."
		""
		"&6Right-click it&r onto your &6Ritual Brazier&r and then drop into it one Weld Horn, Wilden Spike and Wilden Wing."
		""
		"&6Even right-click&r the ritual and then the &dWilden Chimera&r will be summoned."
	]
	quest.1A7F8B304EB4C71E.quest_subtitle: "will you summon this creature...?"
	quest.1A7F8B304EB4C71E.title: "&fSummon &dWilden Chimera&f!"
	quest.1AE94A229CED507D.quest_subtitle: "I prefer both not gonna lie"
	quest.1AE94A229CED507D.title: "&fDo you prefer &6Sweet &for &6Savory&f?"
	quest.1AFB9008D41F2F5A.quest_subtitle: "Fourth Tier"
	quest.1AFB9008D41F2F5A.title: "&6Fiery Armor Set"
	quest.1BE15E20AD9EF309.quest_desc: [
		"&6A Mechanical Drill moved by Contraptions will break blocks and damage entities with which it collides without needing a direct supply of Rotational Force.&r"
		""
		"&6The time it takes for a Mechanical Drill to break a block is based on the Contraption's speed and the block's Hardness value.&r "
		""
		"The damage dealt to entities is also based on the Contraption's speed."
	]
	quest.1BE15E20AD9EF309.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Drill is a block used to break blocks."
	quest.1BE15E20AD9EF309.title: "&6Mechanical Drill&r"
	quest.1C00E8E3FBD8F985.quest_subtitle: "it's very simple haha"
	quest.1C00E8E3FBD8F985.title: "&6Gold&r &fTier!"
	quest.1C25C8794B0F4C59.quest_desc: ["The &6Tilt Adapter&r is a block that &6rotates&r shafts and attached mechanical components (like propellers or bearings) by specific, configurable angles."]
	quest.1C25C8794B0F4C59.title: "&6Tilt Adapter"
	quest.1C67F3C24FF4AFED.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Raven Feather&r is an item dropped by &6Forest Ravens&r, which are often found near obsidian monoliths."
		""
		"It is a critical crafting component used to create a &6Magic Map Focus&r by combining it with Torchberries and Glowstone Dust, enabling the creation of Magic Maps to track boss locations. "
	]
	quest.1C67F3C24FF4AFED.quest_subtitle: "Are you going to craft this?"
	quest.1C67F3C24FF4AFED.title: "&fRaven Feather"
	quest.1D05DE4C390BBE27.quest_subtitle: "In this place resides a monstrous creature that seems peaceful, and if you approach it, you will not be welcomed as you expected."
	quest.1D289FED65DB89D6.quest_desc: ["This boss will rule the End if you don't defeat him."]
	quest.1D289FED65DB89D6.quest_subtitle: "A massive Shulker?"
	quest.1D315F1F3B2D8EA1.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Minoshroom&r is a mini-boss found in a fenced-in, mushroom-filled chamber at the bottom of the &6Labyrinth&r."
		""
		"Once defeated, it will drop a &6Meef Stroganoff&r and you must eat that to unlock the &6Fire Swamp biome&r, otherwise you will burn everytime you try to walk in that biome."
	]
	quest.1D315F1F3B2D8EA1.quest_subtitle: "A Minotaur or a Cow?"
	quest.1D62890BC165F8A1.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Jar&r that stores up to 100 potions. Potion can be removed by using an &6Empty Bottle&r, &6Potion Flask&r, or &6Arrows&r on the jar."
		""
		"&6Wixies&r will use these jars during &6Potion Autocrafting&r. "
		""
		"The jar may be locked by using a &6Dominion Wand&r while &6sneaking&r. "
		""
		"Locked Jars will only receive the potion it is locked to from Wixies and it can be used with a Comparator."
	]
	quest.1D62890BC165F8A1.title: "&6Potion Jar&r"
	quest.1D789E10B6D0FD56.quest_subtitle: "Used to locate the Cursed Pyramid."
	quest.1D789E10B6D0FD56.title: "&6Eye of Desert&r"
	quest.1D96252F814F60F6.quest_subtitle: "Connects inventories with the Inventory Connector."
	quest.1D96252F814F60F6.title: "&6Inventory Trim&r"
	quest.1D9C787A29FBDA79.title: "&6Tablet of Overgrowth&r"
	quest.1DCFEAC460BC4484.title: "&bAquamancer Armor Set"
	quest.1E7015DEA8F1B6DB.quest_desc: [
		"These are all the first stuff that we need to get started with &bAeronautics&r, but if you're already experienced with this mod, you might know where to start."
		""
		"For my own experience, I always started with the&6 Physics Assembler&r and &6Honey Glue&r where you take certain blocks and &6assemble them&r."
	]
	quest.1E7015DEA8F1B6DB.quest_subtitle: "Just to clarify"
	quest.1E7015DEA8F1B6DB.title: "&bGetting Started!"
	quest.1F54E048E0209E7B.quest_subtitle: "feel free to do this task..."
	quest.1F54E048E0209E7B.title: "Yes, a Barrel. Yes."
	quest.1F89468731A5EC37.title: "&6Platinum Fluid Tank"
	quest.20A8CAEAA413EB22.quest_subtitle: "Connects all of the touching inventories into one. You need a Storage Terminal to access all of your items"
	quest.20A8CAEAA413EB22.title: "&6Inventory Connector!&r"
	quest.21A889DC4604CC28.quest_desc: [
		"Entering the &eTwilight Forest&r dimension is done &6by creating a 2x2 pool of water only 1 block deep&r forms the basis for this portal."
		""
		"Additionally it must be surrounded by &6natural blocks&r including flowers, grass, saplings, and mushrooms. "
		""
		"Once the pool is surrounded in this manner and the portal it can be opened by dropping a Diamond into the water. "
	]
	quest.21A889DC4604CC28.quest_subtitle: "Do you prefer the Overworld or Twilight Forest?"
	quest.21A889DC4604CC28.title: "&eMy Favorite Forest"
	quest.22B82437318CDDF4.quest_desc: ["You enter in the &6Ancient Factory&r and be sure to bring with you the &6Nether Star&r to summon &6The Harbinger&r."]
	quest.22B82437318CDDF4.quest_subtitle: "Why do I need a Nether Star?"
	quest.22B82437318CDDF4.title: "&6Summoning Another Monster&r"
	quest.232A0EC7F1AF985B.quest_desc: ["Not my favorite boss, but it's always funny facing her!"]
	quest.232A0EC7F1AF985B.quest_subtitle: "Scylla is my favorite Boss."
	quest.2390A943C6ECA610.quest_desc: [
		"&6Generates source&r by consuming potions from adjacent &6potion jars&r. "
		""
		"The amount of source varies per potion and is dependent on the complexity of the potion."
		""
		"&6Bonus source&r is given for the length and level of the potion with multipliers for each effect a potion contains. "
		""
		"Utilizing &6Wixies&r and &6Potion Melders&r is recommended for creating &6highly complex potions&r."
	]
	quest.2390A943C6ECA610.title: "&6Alchemical Sourcelink&r"
	quest.23DA367960D08B49.quest_desc: [
		"&6Archwood Logs&r are the sturdy, magical timbers harvested from the vibrant Archwood trees found throughout the world."
		""
		"Infused with natural mana, these logs shimmer with colors corresponding to their type—&6Cascading&r, &6Flourishing&r, &6Blazing&r and &6Vexing&r."
		""
		"They serve as the foundational material for &6magical construction&r, crafting basic tools, and are the primary source for creating &6Archwood Planks&r and other arcane wooden components."
	]
	quest.23DA367960D08B49.quest_subtitle: "i bet you will find the biome"
	quest.23DA367960D08B49.title: "&dGetting New Materials!"
	quest.23E23CC3F14AF05F.quest_subtitle: "better than other shield...?"
	quest.23FD6A955EAE2E30.title: "&6Diamond Tier"
	quest.241341E0EF2991F9.title: "&6Redstone Converter"
	quest.24290E36535637C8.quest_subtitle: "Weird place right?"
	quest.2513E7719AF7791D.quest_desc: ["Mines blocks at &6rapid speeds&r when rotated by a borehead bearing and deposits its drops into the bore."]
	quest.2513E7719AF7791D.title: "&6Rock Cutting Wheel"
	quest.258FEB3AE82C1B65.quest_desc: [
		"On a &6simulated contraption&r, hot air envelopes form an enclosed volume that, when powered from below by a hot air burner or a steam vent, generates lift proportional to the number of enclosed &6hot air blocks&r. "
		""
		"Note that the envelope block itself cannot be filled with hot air, only the &6enclosed air&r blocks can. "
		""
		"As with nearly all forms of lift generation, the amount of lift generated is proportional to &6air pressure&r."
	]
	quest.258FEB3AE82C1B65.quest_subtitle: "We need to fly"
	quest.258FEB3AE82C1B65.title: "&6Hot Air Envelope"
	quest.2601A6DC6F8806F8.quest_subtitle: "The Brass Hand lets you to craft some important components."
	quest.2601A6DC6F8806F8.title: "&6&lAn Important Hand&r"
	quest.26077F6E51CB2D95.quest_subtitle: "This Weapon has got 2 different attacks."
	quest.26077F6E51CB2D95.title: "&6Wither Assault Shoulder Weapon&r"
	quest.27F8367E5B1844FD.quest_subtitle: "Polished Rose Quartz is an important crafting material used in the production of Electron Tubes. "
	quest.27F8367E5B1844FD.title: "&dPolished Rose Quartz&r"
	quest.2890FDE7FED2B18D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Portable Storage Interfaces are used on Contraptions.&r"
		""
		"&6For Portable Storage Interfaces to interact they must face each other at 1 to 2 blocks apart.&r One interface must be on a Contraption, while the other is stationary."
	]
	quest.2890FDE7FED2B18D.quest_subtitle: "The Portable Storage Interface is used to allows Item Transporters to directly interact with Contraption inventories."
	quest.2890FDE7FED2B18D.title: "&6Portable Storage Interface&r"
	quest.28F69A65F5864647.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gearbox can relay rotational power in four horizontal directions.&r "
		""
		"The vertical counterpart, like the normal version, &6can relay power in four vertical directions.&r"
		""
		"When receiving input from any input side (sides with a shaft shape), &6the Gearbox will output/relay rotational power in opposite spin for all of the remaining sides.&r "
		""
		"In another word, when the input is clockwise, the output on the other 3 sides will be anti-clockwise, and vice-versa."
	]
	quest.28F69A65F5864647.quest_subtitle: "The Gearbox is a block used to transfer Rotational power in 4 directions, either horizontally or vertically."
	quest.28F69A65F5864647.title: "&6Gearbox&r"
	quest.290FBB861B285A4E.title: "&6Storage Tool"
	quest.2937113FF2DAA0E9.title: "&6Netherite Tier"
	quest.2A50AAE2C632FB0A.quest_subtitle: "Paint Blocks."
	quest.2A50AAE2C632FB0A.title: "&6Yes, A Paint Kit&r"
	quest.2AA98AA8B6D6B5BD.quest_subtitle: "7.5 Attack Damage"
	quest.2BB6640EEE58D99A.title: "&bAethermancer Armor Set"
	quest.2C10EF13FDCB899F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wheel Mount&r is necessary to use wheels, with it being it's mount. "
		""
		"To use it, &6right click&r it with any wheel and the &6spring automatically&r adjusts in size to fit the wheel."
		""
		"Also, it can be powered &6on the sides&r to have the wheel turn towards that side and the amount the wheel turns depends on the &6signal strength&r and when powered from the top, the brakes will be applied."
	]
	quest.2C10EF13FDCB899F.quest_subtitle: "Gonna use this for sure"
	quest.2C10EF13FDCB899F.title: "&6Wheel Mount"
	quest.2C194BE288FE6D7A.quest_desc: [
		"If you wish to catch more than measly salmon or cod you'll first need a &bStarcatcher's rod&r."
		""
		"Some fishes may &6require&r a specific combination of &6Hooks \\& Bobbers&r, so you keep your eyes on the bobber and &6patiently wait&r for your time to strike!"
	]
	quest.2C194BE288FE6D7A.quest_subtitle: "fishing requires patience, you know that?"
	quest.2C194BE288FE6D7A.title: "&bIt's Fishing Time!"
	quest.2C314CB1909236F9.quest_subtitle: "By getting Iron Sheets, you will be able to craft other components."
	quest.2C314CB1909236F9.title: "&6&lObtain Iron Sheet&r"
	quest.2D2003D15FC819F0.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Deployer can be given items to use with machines or by right clicking the items into the hand.&r"
		""
		"&6The Deployer can be stopped with a Redstone signal.&r Note that a disabled Deployer still consumes SU."
		""
		"The Filter on the side of the Deployer can be adjusted to only use certain items. "
		""
		"The filter is also essential when using a Deployer in a Contraption."
	]
	quest.2D2003D15FC819F0.quest_subtitle: "The Deployer simulates player actions on blocks or entities exactly 2 blocks away from it."
	quest.2D2003D15FC819F0.title: "&6Deployer&r"
	quest.2D3E7772B1C4717B.title: "&6Glazed Tools"
	quest.2D40F74853CC86A7.quest_subtitle: "This comes from vanilla."
	quest.2D40F74853CC86A7.title: "An Ender Chest, yeah"
	quest.2DE8A9CC76C5C11F.title: "&6Tablet of Sunrise&r"
	quest.2E1101918E21C588.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Hot Air Burner&r can be powered by redstone to generate lift by filling balloons with hot air."
		""
		"When powered by redstone, the hot air burner &6gradually fills&r a volume enclosed by hot air envelopes with hot air, generating lift. "
		""
		"The maximum volume of hot air generated can be changed from 5m to 500m on &6configuration panels&r located on the sides of the block."
	]
	quest.2E1101918E21C588.title: "&6Hot Air Burner"
	quest.2E349DE36DB46970.title: "&fStorage Tool"
	quest.2E3BB948CD8DE97A.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Magic Map Focus&r is used to create a &6Blank Magic Map&r, allowing players to track biomes, structures, and boss locations. "
		""
		"It can also be obtained as loot from chests in &6Hollow Hills&r or dropped by Death Tomes."
	]
	quest.2E3BB948CD8DE97A.quest_subtitle: "My favorite Feather :D"
	quest.2E3BB948CD8DE97A.title: "&fMagic Map Focus"
	quest.2E84693A1AC8181C.quest_subtitle: "nothing to say, just watch the recipe"
	quest.2E84693A1AC8181C.title: "&6Getting Every Materials&r"
	quest.2F5FD3CE365D8EF0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Imbues&r certain items with &6Source&r to create new items. "
		""
		"The primary way to obtain &6Source Gems&r, amethyst and &6lapis&r may be used to create &6Source Gems&r."
		""
		"The &6Imbuement Chamber&r will passively accumulate source for recipes, or will draw from &6Source Jars&r 2 block away. "
		""
		"Some recipes require additional items placed in &6pedestals&r within 1 block of the &6Imbuement Chamber&r, such as Essences. "
		""
		"Items in &6pedestals&r will not be consumed."
	]
	quest.2F5FD3CE365D8EF0.quest_subtitle: "Make sure to read every description."
	quest.2F5FD3CE365D8EF0.title: "&5Imbuement Chamber&r"
	quest.2FC21251EDCA60A4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Placing a Belt requires at least two Shafts.&r "
		""
		"&6Place the Belt by right-clicking on the first shaft and then right clicking the second.&r "
		""
		"Regardless of the length, this only consumes one mechanical belt. &6Both shafts must face the same direction.&r"
	]
	quest.2FC21251EDCA60A4.quest_subtitle: "Mechanical Belts are mechanical components that conveys rotation and moves items and entities."
	quest.2FC21251EDCA60A4.title: "&6Mechanical Belt&r"
	quest.303ADAAEDBD01363.title: "&6Tablet of Moonfall&r"
	quest.306D5B06585D7ED2.title: "&6Tablet of Fertility&r"
	quest.30E96481ED2F9D5E.quest_desc: ["Be careful when &6Maledictus&r traps you and will start to crush you down."]
	quest.30E96481ED2F9D5E.quest_subtitle: "You will not defeat me."
	quest.30E96481ED2F9D5E.title: "&bHave Fun with Maledictus!&r"
	quest.313B96582754D009.title: "&bOther Components!"
	quest.3165F5E66D274E06.quest_subtitle: "Used to locate the Sunken City."
