		"&6Gantry Carriages are a Contraption that will collide with unmovable blocks in their path.&r"
		""
		"&6Place Gantry Shafts along where the Gantry Carriage will move.&r Apply Rotational power to the shafts to move the Carriage along them, and invert the power to move it back. Inverting the placement of the shafts will invert all movement. &6Use a Wrench to help change the orientation.&r"
