	quest.5A8D97F208ECE216.quest_desc: [
		"When connected to a component, &6the amount of stress in the system versus the stress capacity is shown by a hand on the face of the Stressometer.&r "
		""
		"The higher the hand is, the more stress there is in the system. "
		""
		"It can also output a &6Redstone Comparator signal, outputting at a strength of 15 when the system is overstressed,&r and 0 when there's no stress at all."
	]
	quest.5A8D97F208ECE216.quest_subtitle: "The Stressometer is used to measure the amount of Stress on a Shaft. This stress is the \"load\" of the system."
