	quest.6B4D1916770325BB.quest_desc: ["You need a &6Necklace of the Desert&r to summon the &6Ancient Remnant&r, you can find it by brushing the &6suspicious sand&r in the Cursed Pyramid"]
	quest.6B4D1916770325BB.quest_subtitle: "Where can I find this Necklace?"
	quest.6B4D1916770325BB.title: "&6Necklace of the Desert&r"
	quest.6B7477E4D8B25CF6.quest_subtitle: "Loads chunk using kinetic energy"
	quest.6B852DDB461C6C09.title: "&cSurtrum Tools"
	quest.6C633B7A9879EA1B.quest_desc: [
		"&6To select a target, Shift+Right-Click the ejector on the desired target block, then place the ejector some distance away.&r "
		""
		"&6The target must be in a straight axial&r (on the same X/Z axis) line from where the Ejector is placed. "
		""
		"&6The maximum range of the selection target is 32 blocks horizontally, and infinite blocks vertically&r, but placing the target higher than 33-35 blocks will only result in a slight increase in launch height."
	]
	quest.6C633B7A9879EA1B.quest_subtitle: "The Weighted Ejector flings items and entities"
	quest.6C633B7A9879EA1B.title: "&6Weighted Ejector&r"
	quest.6D18B2726077EDDB.quest_subtitle: "There are tons of upgrades"
	quest.6D18B2726077EDDB.title: "&6Upgrade Base"
	quest.6D34CE45ED32329D.quest_desc: ["This &6addon&r for the &6Create implements&r stuff that makes distance/dimension doesn't matter for your &6machines&r."]
	quest.6D34CE45ED32329D.quest_subtitle: "Read if you want to understand :)"
	quest.6D34CE45ED32329D.title: "&6What Should I Do...?"
	quest.6D7B6AB0C8D5F698.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain &dSource Gems&r, you must first build an &6Imbuement Chamber&r."
		""
		"An &6Imbuement Chamber&r imbues items inside it with &6Source&r, and will convert them to a new item."
		""
		"To obtain a &dSource Gem&r, place an Amethyst or Lapis inside your &6Imbuement Chamber&r and wait."
		""
		"Imbuement Chambers will consume source from nearby &6Source Jars&r to &6speed up&r any crafting. "
		""
		"Also, a &6Dowsing Rod&r can be used for finding Budding Amethyst &6early&r."
	]
	quest.6D7B6AB0C8D5F698.quest_subtitle: "C'mon this is easy, right?"
	quest.6D7B6AB0C8D5F698.title: "&5A New Gem!&r"
	quest.6DB5C1778F7129F3.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Dowsing Rod&r is a magical tool used to locate &6specific blocks&r, ores, or points of interest hidden within the world. "
		""
		"&6By tuning the rod&r to a particular material, it will vibrate or emit visual cues to guide the user toward the &6nearest source&r, making it an invaluable asset for efficient mining and resource gathering in the &6deep&r."
	]
	quest.6DB5C1778F7129F3.quest_subtitle: "Is it useful?"
	quest.6DB5C1778F7129F3.title: "&6Dowsing Rod&r"
	quest.6E20A33094625673.quest_desc: [
		"&6Encased chain drives may be placed side by side either vertically or horizontally to form a chain passing rotational power among all the blocks.&r "
		""
		"&6The blocks must touch on their sides&r (not axis to side) and &6be in a single straight line to form a chain. &r"
		""
		"The axes of the encased chain drives may be all parallel or blocks &6can be rotated to orient the axis perpendicularly. &r"
		""
		"&6Encased chain drives can also pass rotational power through their rotating axis&r, but this is not a continuation of the same chain."
	]
	quest.6E20A33094625673.quest_subtitle: "The Encased Chain Drive is a block that can transfer rotation much like the Mechanical Belt."
	quest.6E20A33094625673.title: "&6Encased Chain Drive&r"
	quest.6E61A82FDAC576A3.title: "&6Arcanist Armor Set"
	quest.6EFFC63F6050FE3B.title: "&6Pyromancer Armor Set"
	quest.6FA5F60451EB3E13.quest_subtitle: "Do you think that I'm gonna put Netherite Ingots as reward?"
	quest.6FA5F60451EB3E13.title: "&6Netherite Backpack"
	quest.6FAD8AD03BB7389E.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Interfaces must be placed facing each other at 1-2 blocks apart, one on a Contraption with Fluid Tanks and one stationary.&r A Fluid Pump is required to insert or extract liquid from the Contraption. To pump liquids to another tank, simply connect the stationary interface and the fluid tank with fluid pipes, although pumps are required to move the liquids."
		""
		"&6Contraptions will automatically stall for an Interface.&r A Redstone signal can be applied to break off the connection early."
	]
	quest.6FAD8AD03BB7389E.quest_subtitle: "The Portable Fluid Interface is the fluid version of the Portable Storage Interface."
	quest.6FAD8AD03BB7389E.title: "&6Portable Fluid Interface&r"
	quest.701CE009E8B7FA73.quest_subtitle: "Easy to craft, easy to use, easy to recharge it and easy to.. It's just Easy."
	quest.701CE009E8B7FA73.title: "&6Laser Gatling&r"
