	quest.72DD3845D78C0954.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Snow Queen&r is the last boss found at the top of the &6Aurora Palace&r in the &6Glacier biome&r."
		""
		"She appears as a pale blue, humanoid figure with violet eyes who floats on an ice cloud, attacking with ice crystals and freezing magic."
	]
