	quest.7BE08494DA2E6376.title: "&6Netherite&r &fTier!"
	quest.7BF67A79D6B8699C.quest_desc: ["&6The Plough can only be placed on the horizontal face of a solid block&r, however, this block is not necessary to support the Plough after it is placed."]
	quest.7BF67A79D6B8699C.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Plough is a Movement Actor used to break non-collidable blocks and fling entities."
	quest.7BF67A79D6B8699C.title: "&6Mechanical Plough&r"
	quest.7C02B0DF21EDF27A.quest_desc: ["Handles allow the moving of small creations or the player through the use of right-clicking."]
	quest.7C02B0DF21EDF27A.title: "&6Iron Handle"
	quest.7C8E918B045803DA.quest_subtitle: "I'm a Yeti now"
	quest.7C8E918B045803DA.title: "Yeti Armor Set"
	quest.7CB2668E19E4B4B8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sophisticated Storage&r allows you to organize a cool&6 storage system&r and is a good solution for &6beginners&r. "
		""
		"If you want something very simple for the storage system, you can proceed with this &6questline&r."
