	quest.7DCAB3585739830A.quest_subtitle: "This Wireless is a little bit different, link to any terminal by holding shift+right-click and you can access the inventory from looking anywhere else without looking the terminals. It's only good for up to 64 Blocks away. "
	quest.7DCAB3585739830A.title: "&6Advanced Wireless Terminal&r"
